{'symbol': 'HD', 'date': '2019-11-20 22:30:00', 'title': 'THE HOME DEPOT DECLARES THIRD QUARTER CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 19, 2019', 'text': 'THE HOME DEPOT ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A THIRD QUARTER CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.36 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 19, 2019, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 5, 2019.'}